<title>USA: Danskin names Schupak chairman of board.</title>
<headline>Danskin names Schupak chairman of board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danskin Inc said that it has named Donald Schupak chairman of the board, replacing Howard Cooley, who resigned.</p>
<p>Schupak has been a director of the company since October 1996, Danskin said in a statement released late on Friday.</p>
